{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/extras/midashi_01-EN.png?t=1744257606\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The dungeons...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They're mysterious labyrinths found all over the world that have existed for longer than recorded history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Filled with treasures and monsters, each dungeon has drawn countless to its gates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some seek fame, and others seek fortune. Adventurers traverse their depths day and night, and many don't make it out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The danger does nothing to keep people away. As people continued to flock to the dungeons, towns were eventually built and developed around them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This was all long ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even today, many mysteries remain. A young man visits the town in hopes of unraveling some of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/extras/midashi_02-EN.png?t=1744257606\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/extras/screenshot-02-small.png?t=1744257606\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Conquer ever-changing, mysterious dungeons!<br>Delve deeper while facing a series of randomly-selected events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/extras/icon-01-small.png?t=1744257606\" /><strong>\u00a0Action Points</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Action Points are spent when you trigger events or engage in battles within the dungeon. If you run out of Action Points and press forward, you will take damage.<br>You can recover Action Points by using certain items or through specific events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/extras/icon-02-small.png?t=1744257606\" /><strong>\u00a0Corruption</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress through the dungeon, you'll gradually acquire more Corruption. If Corruption exceeds a certain level, you will encounter the &quot;Demon of the Dungeon.&quot;<br>Additionally, during dice rolls, roughly 10% of your current Corruption is deducted from the result.<br>Certain events can reduce Corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Weight</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each item has a set weight.<br>If you exceed the weight limit, you will be unable to act.<br>To avoid this, regularly store items in the deposit box in your room or sell/discard unnecessary items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Days</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A day passes when you rest at the inn or fall in the dungeon.The game will end on the morning of the 16th day.<br>You must also make payments to the guild every five days, so be sure not to miss them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dice Rolls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Success or failure in dungeon events is determined by a dice roll.<br>You can increase your Luck using equipment, improving your rolls and giving yourself an advantage in exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/extras/midashi_03-EN.png?t=1744257606\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/extras/screenshot-01-small.png?t=1744257606\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deepen your relationship with Monica, the heroine.<br>Strengthening your bond might trigger special events...!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/extras/midashi_04-EN.png?t=1744257606\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/extras/Profile_Yamamoto-english.png?t=1744257606\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/extras/Profile_Monica-english.png?t=1744257606\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3603530?t=1744257606","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3603530?t=1744257606","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/80974754efade7e8e83bb707d1885f04cca9ba88/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744257606","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/80974754efade7e8e83bb707d1885f04cca9ba88/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744257606","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Crime (theft, abduction), alcohol consumption, smoking, violence (no blood), and partial nudity."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/extras/midashi_01-EN.png?t=1744257606\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The dungeons...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They're mysterious labyrinths found all over the world that have existed for longer than recorded history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Filled with treasures and monsters, each dungeon has drawn countless to its gates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some seek fame, and others seek fortune. Adventurers traverse their depths day and night, and many don't make it out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The danger does nothing to keep people away. As people continued to flock to the dungeons, towns were eventually built and developed around them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This was all long ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even today, many mysteries remain. A young man visits the town in hopes of unraveling some of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/extras/midashi_02-EN.png?t=1744257606\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/extras/screenshot-02-small.png?t=1744257606\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Conquer ever-changing, mysterious dungeons!<br>Delve deeper while facing a series of randomly-selected events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/extras/icon-01-small.png?t=1744257606\" /><strong>\u00a0Action Points</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Action Points are spent when you trigger events or engage in battles within the dungeon. If you run out of Action Points and press forward, you will take damage.<br>You can recover Action Points by using certain items or through specific events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/extras/icon-02-small.png?t=1744257606\" /><strong>\u00a0Corruption</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress through the dungeon, you'll gradually acquire more Corruption. If Corruption exceeds a certain level, you will encounter the &quot;Demon of the Dungeon.&quot;<br>Additionally, during dice rolls, roughly 10% of your current Corruption is deducted from the result.<br>Certain events can reduce Corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Weight</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each item has a set weight.<br>If you exceed the weight limit, you will be unable to act.<br>To avoid this, regularly store items in the deposit box in your room or sell/discard unnecessary items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Days</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A day passes when you rest at the inn or fall in the dungeon.The game will end on the morning of the 16th day.<br>You must also make payments to the guild every five days, so be sure not to miss them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dice Rolls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Success or failure in dungeon events is determined by a dice roll.<br>You can increase your Luck using equipment, improving your rolls and giving yourself an advantage in exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/extras/midashi_03-EN.png?t=1744257606\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/extras/screenshot-01-small.png?t=1744257606\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deepen your relationship with Monica, the heroine.<br>Strengthening your bond might trigger special events...!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/extras/midashi_04-EN.png?t=1744257606\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/extras/Profile_Yamamoto-english.png?t=1744257606\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/extras/Profile_Monica-english.png?t=1744257606\" /></p>","developers":["tadatada stupid "],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/f80c9c55a7a47f11cb0369744c9df69949ec86c3/header.jpg?t=1744257606","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Dungeon with Girl","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 7 / 8 / 8.1 / 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u21222 Duo<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["DLsite"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Conte\u00fado sexual\nAtos criminosos\nViol\u00eancia","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Sexuelle Andeutungen\nGewalt\nAlkohol / Tabak","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/a68c6c6ef2929fba6590c4b93a72ea959affbde2/ss_a68c6c6ef2929fba6590c4b93a72ea959affbde2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744257606","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akama